    "text": "FIBONACCI\n\nto fib n:\n  n is 1 \u2192 answer 1\n  n is 2 \u2192 answer 1\n  else \u2192 ask fib(n-1)\n     and fib(n-2), then\n     answer their sum\n\n\"Answer\" means give the\nnumber to the bird you\nwere handed."
