  {
   "thing": {
    "kind": "text",
    "text": "TO RUN IT\n\nGive the seven-hole box to\nthe fib robot.\n\nEach call makes two nests,\nsends a copy of itself into\ntwo houses, and dozes\nuntil both nests answer.\n\nfib(6) arrives on the nest\nmarked \"the answer\"."
